---
import { servicesData } from '../data/services';
---

<section class="services-section" id="services">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-en-title">Trouble & Services</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">症状・場所から修理を探す</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        トイレつまり、蛇口からのポタポタ水漏れ、給湯器からのお湯が出ないトラブルなど、<br class="br-pc" />
        水まわりの困りごとにプロが迅速に対処します。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">
      {servicesData.map(service => (
        <div class="card service-card">
          <div class="service-card-top">
            <div class="service-icon-box">{service.icon}</div>
            <div class="service-badges">
              {service.badge && <span class="badge badge-emergency">{service.badge}</span>}
              <span class="badge">緊急度: {service.emergencyLevel}</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="service-card-title">{service.title}</h3>
          <p class="service-card-desc">{service.shortDesc}</p>

          <div class="service-trouble-list">
            <span class="trouble-list-title">よくある症状：</span>
            <ul>
              {service.commonTroubles.slice(0, 3).map(t => (
                <li>{t}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card-bottom">
            <div class="service-price">
              <span class="price-label">修理目安</span>
              <span class="price-value">{service.startingPrice}</span>
            </div>
            <a href={`/services/sample/`} class="service-link-btn" aria-label={`${service.title}の詳細を見る`}>
              詳細・料金 →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- 料金についての注釈ボックス -->
    <div class="services-notice-box">
      <div class="notice-icon">💡</div>
      <div class="notice-text">
        <strong>明瞭見積りをお約束：</strong>
        症状や配管の状況を確認した上で、必ず作業前に確定料金をお伝えします。ご了承のないまま追加作業を行うことは絶対にありません。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-section {
    padding: 70px 0;
    background: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .service-card {
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .service-card-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .service-icon-box {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    background: var(--color-bg-sub);
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(25, 118, 187, 0.15);
  }

  .service-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .service-card-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-main);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .service-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .service-trouble-list {
    background: var(--color-bg-sub);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .trouble-list-title {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-sub);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .service-trouble-list ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .service-trouble-list li {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .service-trouble-list li::before {
    content: '・';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-sub);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .service-card-bottom {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
  }

  .service-price {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .price-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .price-value {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #CF1322;
  }

  .service-link-btn {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-sub);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--color-sub-light);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .service-link-btn:hover {
    background: var(--color-sub);
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .services-notice-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    background: #FFFBE6;
    border: 1px solid #FFE58F;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .notice-icon {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
  }

  .notice-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #874D00;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .services-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
